# Dashboard UI

Pixel-faithful dark gold shell: sidebar, header, KPI grid, forecast/AI panel, activity.

- Gold accent restrained; CSS vars from theme preset `zarva-gold`
- **All metric tiles and content panels** follow the Metric & content boxes law in `surfaces.mdc` (not dashboard-only)
- Card/KPI/panel icons use the dashboard square + accent (`icons.mdc` — Content box icons); label `leading-none` + `items-center` with the square
- Canonical components: `KpiGrid`, `DashboardPanel`, `MetricCardShell` / `MetricCardHeader`, `ForecastChartSkeleton`
- Decompose KPI/chart/AI/activity into small components (≤100 lines)
- Match responsive contracts; RTL-safe
- Progressive sections: `progressive-loading.mdc` (canonical page: `dashboard/page.tsx`)
